{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2021-03-31 19:31:00', 'title': "DUKE ENERGY RESPONDS TO NORTH CAROLINA UTILITIES COMMISSION'S DECISION ON DUKE ENERGY CAROLINAS' 2019 RATE REQUEST", 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C., MARCH 31, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUKE ENERGY ISSUED THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT IN RESPONSE TO TODAY'S ORDER BY THE NORTH CAROLINA UTILITIES COMMISSION (NCUC) ON THE RATE ADJUSTMENT REQUEST MADE BY DUKE ENERGY CAROLINAS ON SEPT."}{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2021-03-31 11:37:00', 'title': 'DUKE ENERGY AWARDS $375,000 IN GRANTS TO SOUTH CAROLINA TUTORING PROGRAMS, EDUCATION INITIATIVES IMPACTED BY PANDEMIC', 'text': 'GREENVILLE, S.C., MARCH 31, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUKE ENERGY ANNOUNCED TODAY THE RECIPIENTS OF $375,000 IN GRANTS THROUGH THE DUKE ENERGY FOUNDATION TO SOUTH CAROLINA ORGANIZATIONS THAT WILL FUND TUTORING AND READING PROGRAMS IN UNDERSERVED AND MINORITY COMMUNITIES TO COMBAT LEARNING GAPS CREATED BY THE PANDEMIC.'}